    "text": "Starting at temperature <math><mn>300</mn><mi></mi><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></math> one mole of an ideal diatomic gas <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is first compressed adiabatically from volume <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> to <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> It is then allowed to expand isobarically to volume <math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . If all the processes are the quasi-static then the final temperature of the gas (in <math><msup><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>K</mi></math> ) is (to the nearest integer) ___________.",
